     A          R HLLIST
     A                                  1  2'Help - Mailbox'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Memos sent to you, newest first.  -
     A                                      Unread ones are bright, with a star-
     A                                      .'
     A                                  4  3'F10 switches between your mailbox -
     A                                      and the mail you have sent.'
     A                                  6  3'Options: 4 deletes, 5 opens the me-
     A                                      mo.'
     A                                  7  3'You can also put the cursor on a l-
     A                                      ine and press Enter to pick it.'
     A                                  9  3'F6 writes a new memo.  F4 searches-
     A                                       all of your office items.'
     A                                 10  3'F7 and F8 page backward and forwar-
     A                                      d through a long list.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HLCOMP
     A                                  1  2'Help - Compose mail'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'Fill in who it is for, a subject a-
     A                                      nd up to eight lines, then press En-
     A                                      ter.'
     A                                  5  3'To can be a user ID, the name of a-
     A                                       distribution group, or ALL for eve-
     A                                      ryone.'
     A                                  6  3'F4 opens a list of enrolled users -
     A                                      to pick from.'
     A                                  8  3'F12 leaves without sending.'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
     A          R HLREAD
     A                                  1  2'Help - Read mail'
     A                                      DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  3  3'F6 replies to the sender.'
     A                                  4  3'F9 forwards the memo to someone el-
     A                                      se, with the text copied in.'
     A                                  5  3'F10 prints the memo.  Find it unde-
     A                                      r Printed output on the main menu.'
     A                                  6  3'Enter or F12 goes back to the list-
     A                                      .'
     A                                 23  2'Press Enter to return.'
     A                                      COLOR(BLU)
